      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related by:\nimprove the req Invite problem\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/improve-the-req-invite-problem\nMisleading (or buggy?) text on request invites in friend-only instances\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/misleading-or-buggy-text-on-request-invites-in-friend-only-instances",
